                    and Iran, signed at Tehran, January 29, 1942, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, March 21, 1942, p. 249.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d121-f2" n="61" xml:id="d121-f2-content">
                <p>September 12, “Draft Agreement Establishing Emergency Regime for European Inland
